SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH   2
    pe   4
    units mmol/kgw
    Cu   10
    Ba   5
    Cl   30 charge

KINETICS 1
    Calcite
        -m0    1
        -m     1
        -parms 1.0  1.0
        -tol   1e-12
        -steps 10  in 100

RATES
Calcite
-start
10 rate = PARM(1) * 10.0
20 moles = rate * TIME
30 if (M <= 0) then moles = 0
40 SAVE moles
-end

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
    -time true
    -pH true
END
